#. module: account_sepa_direct_debit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_sepa_direct_debit.field_account_batch_payment__sdd_scheme
msgid ""
"The B2B scheme is an optional scheme,\n"
"offered exclusively to business payers.\n"
"Some banks/businesses might not accept B2B SDD."
msgstr ""
"Systemet för B2B är ett valfritt system,\n"
"som enbart erbjuds till betalande företag.\n"
"Vissa banker/företag kan välja att inte acceptera ett B2B SDD-system."

#. module: account_sepa_direct_debit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/account_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"The SEPA Direct Debit mandate associated to the payment has been revoked and "
"cannot be used anymore."
msgstr ""
"Fullmakterna för SEPA-direktdebitering kopplade till betalningen har "
"återkallats och kan inte längre användas."

#. module: account_sepa_direct_debit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/account_batch_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"The bank needs to be informed at least %(min_days_new)s days in advance for "
"collections related to a new mandate and %(min_days)s days in advance when "
"the mandate is already known by them.\n"
"The minimum collection date must be %(date)s."
msgstr ""
"Banken måste informeras minst %(min_days_new)s dagar på förhand vid "
"insamlingar relaterade till en ny fullmakt och minst %(min_days)s dagar på "
"förhand när fullmakten redan är känd av banken.\n"
"Minsta insamlingsdatum bör vara %(date)s."

#. module: account_sepa_direct_debit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/res_company.py:0
